# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function sizes {#function-sizes}"
msgstr "Ukuran function {#function-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job runs at one size — `S`, `M`, or `L`. If the specified size is too small, the job is rejected. If the size is larger than needed, it runs on a bigger compute profile than the work requires.\n"
msgstr "Setiap job berjalan pada satu ukuran — `S`, `M`, atau `L`. Kalau ukuran yang ditentukan terlalu kecil, job ditolak. Kalau ukurannya lebih besar dari yang dibutuhkan, job berjalan pada compute profile yang lebih besar daripada kebutuhan pekerjaannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The size of a Rimay job depends on the number of samples it maps: the rows of `x_train` and `x_test` for `fit-transform`, and the rows of `x_inference` for `transform`. The labels in `y_train` do not count, and a `delete` run maps no samples.\n"
msgstr "Ukuran job Rimay bergantung pada jumlah sampel yang dipetakannya: baris `x_train` dan `x_test` untuk `fit-transform`, dan baris `x_inference` untuk `transform`. Label di `y_train` tidak dihitung, dan run `delete` tidak memetakan sampel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Size | Samples per job | Compute profile | vCPU | RAM |\n"
"| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n"
"| `S` | Up to 2,999 | `8x32` | 8 | 32 GB |\n"
"| `M` | 3,000 to 9,999 | `8x32` | 8 | 32 GB |\n"
"| `L` | 10,000 to 15,000 | `16x128` | 16 | 128 GB |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ukuran | Sampel per job | Compute profile | vCPU | RAM |\n"
"| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n"
"| `S` | Hingga 2.999 | `8x32` | 8 | 32 GB |\n"
"| `M` | 3.000 sampai 9.999 | `8x32` | 8 | 32 GB |\n"
"| `L` | 10.000 sampai 15.000 | `16x128` | 16 | 128 GB |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The number of samples is the only criterion. A size changes nothing but the compute profile: the [limits](#limits) on features, samples, and shots are the same for every size. `S` and `M` run on the same compute profile and differ in the number of samples each covers.\n"
msgstr "Jumlah sampel adalah satu-satunya kriteria. Ukuran tidak mengubah apa pun selain compute profile: [batasan](#limits) untuk fitur, sampel, dan shot sama untuk setiap ukuran. `S` dan `M` berjalan pada compute profile yang sama dan hanya berbeda pada jumlah sampel yang dicakup masing-masing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default is `M`, used when a job does not request a size. A job of more than 9,999 samples must therefore request `L`.\n"
msgstr "Default-nya `M`, yang dipakai ketika job tidak meminta ukuran. Karena itu, job dengan lebih dari 9.999 sampel harus meminta `L`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also read the mapping off the function itself with `rimay.sizes_map`, and the size that a job runs at when it does not request one with `rimay.default_size`.\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa membaca pemetaan itu dari function-nya langsung dengan `rimay.sizes_map`, dan ukuran yang dipakai job ketika tidak meminta ukuran dengan `rimay.default_size`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the size before submitting {#calculate-the-size-before-submitting}"
msgstr "Hitung ukuran sebelum mengirim {#calculate-the-size-before-submitting}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this on your own inputs. It reads them and does nothing else: no job is submitted and nothing is reserved, so you can call it as often as you like.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan ini pada inputmu sendiri. Ini hanya membaca input dan tidak melakukan hal lain: tidak ada job yang dikirim dan tidak ada yang dicadangkan, jadi kamu bisa memanggilnya sesering yang kamu mau.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass the data sets themselves, not their file names, in the same order as `input_file`, together with the `mode` of the run. [Step 2 of the example](#2-run-the-function) shows the call.\n"
msgstr "Berikan dataset-nya langsung, bukan nama file-nya, dengan urutan yang sama seperti `input_file`, beserta `mode` dari run. [Langkah 2 pada contoh](#2-run-the-function) menunjukkan pemanggilannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the size is too small, the job fails with error `4600` and the message names the size to use instead. If it is larger than needed, the job runs normally and records a `4601` advisory event.\n"
msgstr "Kalau ukurannya terlalu kecil, job gagal dengan error `4600` dan pesannya menyebutkan ukuran yang harus dipakai. Kalau lebih besar dari yang dibutuhkan, job berjalan normal dan mencatat event advisory `4601`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example {#example}"
msgstr "Contoh {#example}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example shows how to upload data, run the function, and retrieve the quantum-transformed features. For an end-to-end example that includes the preprocessing and the training of the classical model, see the [tutorial](/tutorials/classify-credit-risk-with-rimay-quantum-feature-extraction).\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menunjukkan cara mengunggah data, menjalankan function, dan mengambil fitur hasil transformasi kuantum. Untuk contoh end-to-end yang mencakup praproses dan pelatihan model klasik, lihat [tutorial](/tutorials/classify-credit-risk-with-rimay-quantum-feature-extraction).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Upload the data {#1-upload-the-data}"
msgstr "1. Unggah data {#1-upload-the-data}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example uses a small synthetic dataset with four numeric features and a binary label, so that a run needs only four qubits and finishes quickly. The next cell writes it to four CSV files: the training features, the training labels, the test features, and the features for step 4 of this example. To use your own data, write your preprocessed training and test sets to files with the same layout instead.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini memakai dataset sintetis kecil dengan empat fitur numerik dan satu label biner, jadi sebuah run hanya butuh empat qubit dan selesai dengan cepat. Cell berikutnya menulisnya ke empat file CSV: fitur pelatihan, label pelatihan, fitur pengujian, dan fitur untuk langkah 4 contoh ini. Untuk memakai datamu sendiri, tulis set pelatihan dan pengujian yang sudah dipraproses ke file dengan layout yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the training and test files. You upload `x_inference.csv` in step 4.\n"
msgstr "Unggah file pelatihan dan pengujian. Kamu mengunggah `x_inference.csv` di langkah 4.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Run the function {#2-run-the-function}"
msgstr "2. Jalankan function {#2-run-the-function}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the size of the run from the data that you uploaded, with the calculator from [Function sizes](#calculate-the-size-before-submitting).\n"
msgstr "Hitung ukuran run dari data yang kamu unggah, dengan kalkulator dari [Ukuran function](#calculate-the-size-before-submitting).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select a processor with at least as many qubits as your data has features, and run the function in `fit-transform` mode with that size. The sample data has four features, so any IBM Quantum processor can run it.\n"
msgstr "Pilih prosesor dengan qubit minimal sebanyak fitur pada datamu, lalu jalankan function dalam mode `fit-transform` dengan ukuran itu. Data contoh punya empat fitur, jadi prosesor IBM Quantum mana pun bisa menjalankannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the workload's [status](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status) or return [results](/guides/functions-get-started#retrieve-results) as follows:\n"
msgstr "Cek [status](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status) workload atau ambil [hasil](/guides/functions-get-started#retrieve-results) sebagai berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Retrieve the results {#3-retrieve-the-results}"
msgstr "3. Ambil hasilnya {#3-retrieve-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the quantum-transformed features. Pass `target_name` so that each file is saved under its own name.\n"
msgstr "Unduh fitur hasil transformasi kuantum. Berikan `target_name` supaya setiap file disimpan dengan namanya sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Map new data {#4-map-new-data}"
msgstr "4. Petakan data baru {#4-map-new-data}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you train your model, map new data with the fitted mapping, for example to run inference. This example maps `x_inference.csv`, which the first cell of this example wrote. Pass the `mapping_id` that the fit returned, so that the new rows are mapped with the same mapping instead of a new one.\n"
msgstr "Setelah melatih modelmu, petakan data baru dengan mapping hasil fit, misalnya untuk menjalankan inferensi. Contoh ini memetakan `x_inference.csv`, yang ditulis oleh cell pertama contoh ini. Berikan `mapping_id` yang dikembalikan fit, supaya baris baru dipetakan dengan mapping yang sama, bukan mapping baru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A mapping is built for the qubit layout of one processor, so pass the same `backend_name` as the fit, which the fit returned in `result[\"backend_name\"]`. Do not use `least_busy()` to choose the processor, because it might return a different one. Rimay rejects any other processor before it submits anything. The shot count also comes from the fit.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah mapping dibangun untuk layout qubit satu prosesor, jadi berikan `backend_name` yang sama dengan fit, yang dikembalikan fit di `result[\"backend_name\"]`. Jangan pakai `least_busy()` untuk memilih prosesor, karena bisa mengembalikan prosesor yang berbeda. Rimay menolak prosesor lain sebelum mengirim apa pun. Jumlah shot juga berasal dari fit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Delete a mapping {#5-delete-a-mapping}"
msgstr "5. Hapus mapping {#5-delete-a-mapping}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you no longer need a fitted mapping, delete it. A `delete` run does no quantum work, so it needs no processor, no shots, and no function size. You cannot undo a deletion. After deletion, the `mapping_id` no longer refers to anything, and a `transform` run with it fails.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu sudah tidak membutuhkan fitted mapping, hapus saja. Run `delete` tidak melakukan pekerjaan kuantum apa pun, jadi tidak perlu prosesor, shot, maupun function size. Penghapusan tidak bisa dibatalkan. Setelah dihapus, `mapping_id` tidak merujuk ke apa pun lagi, dan run `transform` dengan ID itu akan gagal.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Ambil pesan error {#fetch-error-messages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your workload status is `ERROR`, use `job.error_message()` to fetch the error message, as follows:\n"
msgstr "Kalau status workload kamu `ERROR`, pakai `job.error_message()` untuk mengambil pesan error, sebagai berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every error that Rimay reports carries a code from the [IBM Quantum error codes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/errors), a message, and a solution that names the value that you passed and the value that is allowed. The following table lists the most common errors:\n"
msgstr "Setiap error yang dilaporkan Rimay membawa kode dari [kode error IBM Quantum](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/errors), sebuah pesan, dan solusi yang menyebutkan nilai yang kamu berikan dan nilai yang diizinkan. Tabel berikut mendaftar error yang paling umum:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Code | Cause |\n"
"| :-- | :-- |\n"
"| `1221` | A parameter is missing or has the wrong type, `mode` is not valid, a file named in `input_file` was not uploaded, the files do not match each other, a feature is not numeric, or the `mapping_id` does not match a stored mapping. |\n"
"| `1221` | A `\"transform\"` run names a different `backend_name` than the fit that produced its mapping. |\n"
"| `1216` | Your instance has no processor with the `backend_name` that you passed. The solution lists the processors it does have. |\n"
"| `1200` | Your API key does not have access to the instance that the job runs under. |\n"
"| `3200` | `backend_name` does not start with `ibm_`. |\n"
"| `4500` | The data has more features than the processor has qubits. |\n"
"| `6000` | The number of samples times `shots` exceeds 10 million executions. |\n"
"| `6001` | `shots` is smaller than 1. |\n"
"| `6002` | The data has more samples than a run allows. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kode | Penyebab |\n"
"| :-- | :-- |\n"
"| `1221` | Ada parameter yang hilang atau bertipe salah, `mode` tidak valid, file yang disebut di `input_file` belum diunggah, file-file tidak cocok satu sama lain, ada fitur yang tidak numerik, atau `mapping_id` tidak cocok dengan mapping yang tersimpan. |\n"
"| `1221` | Run `\"transform\"` menyebut `backend_name` yang berbeda dari fit yang menghasilkan mapping-nya. |\n"
"| `1216` | Instance kamu tidak punya prosesor dengan `backend_name` yang kamu berikan. Solusinya mendaftar prosesor yang dimilikinya. |\n"
"| `1200` | API key kamu tidak punya akses ke instance tempat job berjalan. |\n"
"| `3200` | `backend_name` tidak diawali `ibm_`. |\n"
"| `4500` | Data punya lebih banyak fitur daripada jumlah qubit prosesor. |\n"
"| `6000` | Jumlah sampel dikali `shots` melebihi 10 juta eksekusi. |\n"
"| `6001` | `shots` lebih kecil dari 1. |\n"
"| `6002` | Data punya lebih banyak sampel daripada yang diizinkan satu run. |\n"

